<title>PORTUGAL: Salomon launches 5 bln esc 5-yr Navigator.</title>
<headline>Salomon launches 5 bln esc 5-yr Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc is launching a five-year five billion escudo Navigator bond indexed to six-month Lisbor plus 30 basis points, with the bonds being issued at par, said Banco Finantia, leader and bookrunner.</p>
<p>Details of issue:</p>
<p>ISSUER: Salomon Inc</p>
<p>TYPE: Private issue</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 5 bln esc</p>
<p>TERM: 5 years</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE: 100.00 percent</p>
<p>NOMINAL VALUE: 1,000,000 escudos per share</p>
<p>PAYMENT DATE: 18 June 1997</p>
<p>INTEREST RATE: six-month Lisbor plus 30 basis points</p>
<p>PAYMENT OF INTEREST: six-monthly on June 18 and December 18</p>
<p>each year</p>
<p>BUSINESS DAYS: Lisbon and New York</p>
<p>REIMBURSEMENT: one time, at par on June 18 2002</p>
<p>LISTING: to be sought on Luxembourg stock exchange</p>
<p>APPLICABLE LAW: State of New York</p>
<p>RATINGS: Baa1 (Moody's), BBB (S&amp;P) and A- (IBCA)</p>
<p>LEADER AND BOOKRUNNER: Banco Finantia</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
